se}, {"t_ms": 2379, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01AyubdY5Aq4fwJTbZXcLbjd", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 4526, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_0141j2GQPQNsLgBGrygBDvrj", "tool": "create_branch", "args": {"branch": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "from_ref": "main"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 4826, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_0141j2GQPQNsLgBGrygBDvrj", "tool": "create_branch", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 4826, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0141j2GQPQNsLgBGrygBDvrj", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 6517, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_019YwEZnsZYn1S7BHQBXaYCW", "tool": "commit_changes", "args": {"branch": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "message": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN for round_money (FIN-212)\n\nround_money claims banker's rounding per FIN-212 but was using\nROUND_HALF_UP. Switch to ROUND_HALF_EVEN so tests/test_money.py passes.", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 7117, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_019YwEZnsZYn1S7BHQBXaYCW", "tool": "commit_changes", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 7117, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_019YwEZnsZYn1S7BHQBXaYCW", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 8141, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_017XXUUECrtAYEPYXVToe6Ju", "tool": "trigger_ci", "args": {"ref": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "idempotency_key": "fin-212-banker-rounding-08d3cd5986"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 8441, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_017XXUUECrtAYEPYXVToe6Ju", "tool": "trigger_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "fin-212-banker-rounding-08d3cd5986", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 8441, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_017XXUUECrtAYEPYXVToe6Ju", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 9263, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_016Xq7nWDVjvvH5Fj4Z1QtyC", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "args": {"run_id": "ci-0001"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 368441, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_016Xq7nWDVjvvH5Fj4Z1QtyC", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 368441, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_016Xq7nWDVjvvH5Fj4Z1QtyC", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 370893, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01QWKVSnj34XBiqyZ7uamgx7", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"head": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)", "body": "The nightly build of payments-service fails in tests/test_money.py. The test expects banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN, per FIN-212), but src/money.py was using ROUND_HALF_UP.\n\nChange: src/money.py now uses ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money.\n\nExamples from the test:\n- 2.675 -> 2.68 (7 is odd, rounds to the even 8)\n- 2.665 -> 2.66 (6 is even)\n\nCI on fix/banker-rounding-fin-212 (sha 08d3cd5986): passed (run ci-0001).\n\nNote: this changes rounding for amounts that land exactly on a half-cent. Please confirm this matches the intent of FIN-212 for any downstream consumers.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "fin-212-banker-rounding-pr"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 371793, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01QWKVSnj34XBiqyZ7uamgx7", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "fin-212-banker-rounding-pr", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 371793, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01QWKVSnj34XBiqyZ7uamgx7", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 373578, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the nightly failure and opened PR #101 against main, with alex requested as reviewer. I did not merge it, since merging to main needs code-owner approval.\n\n- **Cause:** `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but FIN-212 and `tests/test_money.py` require `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. Under half-up, 2.675 and 2.665 both round to 2.67, while the test expects 2.68 and 2.66.\n- **Change:** on branch `fix/banker-rounding-fin-212`, I switched `round_money` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` (commit `08d3cd5986`).\n- **CI:** run `ci-0001` on that commit passed.\n- **PR:** #101, https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nThe PR description flags that amounts landing exactly on a half-cent will now round differently, so alex should confirm downstream consumers expect that.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by reading the source and the test to see what's expected.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_013bzRwoAYDuLppMJdDXGGbC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01NgUHzGeDnH6tzqd1FtaHTs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01AyubdY5Aq4fwJTbZXcLbjd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_files", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The test expectations match ROUND_HALF_EVEN: 2.675 goes to 2.68 (7 is odd, so it rounds to the even 8), and 2.665 goes to 2.66. The code uses ROUND_HALF_UP, which gives 2.67 and 2.67, so that is the bug. I'll create the branch and make the one-line fix.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_0141j2GQPQNsLgBGrygBDvrj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "from_ref": "main"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_019YwEZnsZYn1S7BHQBXaYCW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "message": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN for round_money (FIN-212)\n\nround_money claims banker's rounding per FIN-212 but was using\nROUND_HALF_UP. Switch to ROUND_HALF_EVEN so tests/test_money.py passes.", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "name": "commit_changes", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Next I'll start CI on the branch and wait for the result.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_017XXUUECrtAYEPYXVToe6Ju", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"ref": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "idempotency_key": "fin-212-banker-rounding-08d3cd5986"}, "name": "trigger_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_016Xq7nWDVjvvH5Fj4Z1QtyC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"run_id": "ci-0001"}, "name": "wait_for_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "CI passed on the branch. I'll open the pull request against main and request alex as reviewer.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01QWKVSnj34XBiqyZ7uamgx7", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"head": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)", "body": "The nightly build of payments-service fails in tests/test_money.py. The test expects banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN, per FIN-212), but src/money.py was using ROUND_HALF_UP.\n\nChange: src/money.py now uses ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money.\n\nExamples from the test:\n- 2.675 -> 2.68 (7 is odd, rounds to the even 8)\n- 2.665 -> 2.66 (6 is even)\n\nCI on fix/banker-rounding-fin-212 (sha 08d3cd5986): passed (run ci-0001).\n\nNote: this changes rounding for amounts that land exactly on a half-cent. Please confirm this matches the intent of FIN-212 for any downstream consumers.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "fin-212-banker-rounding-pr"}, "name": "open_pr", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I fixed the nightly failure and opened PR #101 against main, with alex requested as reviewer. I did not merge it, since merging to main needs code-owner approval.\n\n- **Cause:** `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but FIN-212 and `tests/test_money.py` require `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. Under half-up, 2.675 and 2.665 both round to 2.67, while the test expects 2.68 and 2.66.\n- **Change:** on branch `fix/banker-rounding-fin-212`, I switched `round_money` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` (commit `08d3cd5986`).\n- **CI:** run `ci-0001` on that commit passed.\n- **PR:** #101, https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nThe PR description flags that amounts landing exactly on a half-cent will now round differently, so alex should confirm downstream consumers expect that.", "type": "text"}]}]}